# Build context exclusions.
#
# Everything here is either a build artifact that the image rebuilds itself or a
# local-only tree that costs upload time for nothing. `dashboard/frontend` is the
# reason this file exists: the image builds the bundle in its own stage, and
# without these two lines a developer's 66 MB `node_modules` is uploaded with
# every build and then copied *over* the one `npm ci` just installed from the
# lockfile -- so the image would ship whatever happened to be on that laptop.

dashboard/frontend/node_modules/
dashboard/frontend/dist/
dashboard/frontend/.vite/

# Written by scripts/bundle_frontend.py for wheel builds; the image has no use
# for a stale copy.
dashboard/rlinf_dashboard/static/

# Python build and test artifacts.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/

# Local environments and editor state.
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
